    {
      "id": "driver_step1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "1. get_env_variables(spark) → detect dev/qa/prod\n2. IncrementalTracker.get_new_files() → 48 BlobInfo (SDK listing + watermark)\n3. Filter by extension (.xlsx/.csv) + skip exhausted retries\n4. spark.createDataFrame(48 rows) → each Row = file descriptor (NOT data!)\n5. .repartition(ceil(48/8) = 6) → 6 partitions = 6 tasks\n6. .rdd.mapPartitions(_process_partition) → distribute to workers",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 5,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 5,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "driver_formula",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "┌─────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  KEY FORMULAS:                      │\n│                                     │\n│  tasks = ceil(N_files / FPP)        │\n│  slots/worker = cores / task.cpus   │\n│  concurrent = tasks × THREADS       │\n│  autoscale if tasks > slots         │\n└─────────────────────────────────────┘",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#9333ea",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 6,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 6,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
