    {
      "id": "nested_thread_note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 1190,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "NOTE: Inside each thread processing an .xlsx file, there is ANOTHER ThreadPool for multi-sheet parallelism:\n  Thread A processing file_0.xlsx (3 sheets) → inner ThreadPool(3) → 3 sheet-threads\n  This is already accounted for in the benchmark measurement of ~2 cores/file.\n  CSV files do NOT have this inner ThreadPool (single group, no sheets).",
      "fontSize": 12,
